6T11:00:00Z\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"p3\",\n        \"inv2\",\n        2500,\n        \"2024-01-06T12:00:00Z\"\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"payment_orphans\": [\n      [\n        \"p4\",\n        \"missing-invoice\",\n        700,\n        \"2024-01-07T10:00:00Z\",\n        \"missing invoice during billing migration\"\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"invalid_refs\": [\n      [\n        0\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"fk_check\": [],\n    \"payments_sql\": \"CREATE TABLE \\\"payments\\\" (\\n  id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\\n  invoice_id TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  amount_cents INTEGER NOT NULL,\\n  created_at TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  FOREIGN KEY (invoice_id) REFERENCES invoices(id)\\n)\"\n  },\n  \"second\": {\n    \"invoices\": [\n      [\n        \"inv1\",\n        \"cust-a\",\n        1200,\n        \"2024-01-03T10:00:00Z\",\n        \"open\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"inv2\",\n        \"cust-b\",\n        5000,\n        \"2024-01-04T10:00:00Z\",\n        \"open\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"inv3\",\n        \"cust-a\",\n        800,\n        \"2024-01-05T10:00:00Z\",\n        \"open\"\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"payments\": [\n      [\n        \"p1\",\n        \"inv1\",\n        1200,\n        \"2024-01-06T10:00:00Z\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"p2\",\n        \"inv2\",\n        2500,\n        \"2024-01-06T11:00:00Z\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"p3\",\n        \"inv2\",\n        2500,\n        \"2024-01-06T12:00:00Z\"\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"payment_orphans\": [\n      [\n        \"p4\",\n        \"missing-invoice\",\n        700,\n        \"2024-01-07T10:00:00Z\",\n        \"missing invoice during billing migration\"\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"invalid_refs\": [\n      [\n        0\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"fk_check\": []\n  },\n  \"post_rollback\": {\n    \"invoice_cols\": [\n      \"id\",\n      \"customer_id\",\n      \"total_cents\",\n      \"created_at\"\n    ],\n    \"payment_cols\": [\n      \"id\",\n      \"invoice_id\",\n      \"amount_cents\",\n      \"created_at\"\n    ],\n    \"invoices