ault `open`.\n- Preserve historical invoice `created_at`.\n- Preserve orphan payments by moving them to `payment_orphans` before enforcing referential safety.\n- Enforce future `payments.invoice_id` references to valid invoices.\n- The migration must run inside an explicit transaction.\n- The migration must be idempotent: running it a second time must not duplicate or corrupt data.\n- Rollback must execute after the migration and restore the old table shape: `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify `schema.sql` or `migration_policy.md`.\n- Do not delete orphan payment `p4`; preserve it in `payment_orphans`.\n- Do not disable foreign keys without restoring them.\n- Do not hard-code a solution that only works by deleting existing rows.\n- Do not use external services or non-SQLite features.\n"}],"timestamp":1788195888303},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating workflow necessity for migration repair**\n\n**Planning todo creation and workflow inspection**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_03a1a0e00cb0d594016a95b432820087d2a52e7d7198bea3d6\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating workflow necessity for migration repair**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning todo creation and workflow inspection**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Wmfazh8iP7YeD5dx3EPnNudy|fc_03a1a0e00cb0d594016a95b436637487d2bd4de83735a6b1a0","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","title":"Repair SQLite billing migration package","status":"in_progress","tags":["sql","migration","billing"],"body":"Read migration policy and current schema/migration files, repair migration.sql for safety/idempotence, create preflight_report.md, rollback.sql, postcheck.sql, and migration_report.md, then validate against requirements."}}],"